%% I> L1 DISTIL  :: proposed

   method : local Qwen (:19128, already resident) reads admitted chunks in batches
            -> emits typed claims. zero cloud cost, zero new GPU contention
            (one engine, one port, established today).
   claim  := {axis, statement, evidence:[chunk_id + text_sha256], first_seen,
              last_seen, corroborations, contradicted_by}
   W! provenance REQUIRED. unprovenanced claim -> inadmissible. inherits the
      existing ANAMNESIS contract, N! a new one.
   W! reconcile >> re-derive : PERSONA.csl + CLAUDE.md + MEMORY.md already encode
      much of PROCEDURE/METHODOLOGY. distiller CITES or CONTRADICTS them ;
      N! parallel truth.
   W! contradiction -> killed_by, append. G11. N! overwrite.

%% I> L2 ADMIT  :: proposed

   store   : apocrypha-profile.db, SEPARATE from anamnesis.db
             <- different consent surface ; keeps the ledger clean ; independently
                deletable. (see FORK F3)
   adapter : new READ-ONLY gateway adapter 'profile' alongside the existing five
   prompt  : profile facts join the evidence message (N! the system message)
   W! budget : memoryContextChars = 12,000 total. profile block must be RANKED +
      SMALL -- top-N relevant to the live turn. N! dump. a profile that evicts
      the reading or the recall has made Apocrypha worse, not better.

%% I> L3 LOOP  :: the autonomous part ; proposed

   daily pass : index new transcripts -> stratify -> distil -> write CANDIDATES
   W! candidates land in quarantine, N! the live store.
      <- "write-back OFF by default ; a default is not consent"
   promotion  : FORK F1
   decay      : claim contradicted by newer evidence -> killed_by + reason
   observable : census + candidate count + promotion log. a pass that produces no
                artifact cannot be observed to have fired (G2).

%% I> FORKS  :: [[Apocky]] decides. N! assumed.

   F1 PROMOTION -- the consent fork
      a) manual queue : nothing reaches the live mind without your review
      b) auto-promote @ N>=3 independent corroborations /\ 0 contradictions
      c) auto-promote all, fully reversible, audit log + one-command revert
      recommend (b) : (a) makes "autonomous" false and puts you back in the loop
      daily ; (c) has no floor. (b) has a measurable floor and still runs alone.

   F2 PUBLIC EXPOSURE -- the blast-radius fork
      does the profile shape the PUBLIC apocky.com Apocrypha, or local+work only?
      pro : you said "same mind across all invocations/instantiations" @2026-09-14
      con : a profile of YOU shaping a public persona surfaces your mannerisms,
            corrections and register to strangers.
      recommend : profile drives VOICE+METHOD everywhere ; CORRECTION and
      PREFERENCE axes stay private (local+work). one mind, but it does not recite
      your corrections to the public.

   F3 STORE
      a) separate apocrypha-profile.db   (recommend)
      b) new tables inside anamnesis.db
      recommend (a) : deletable in one move without touching the ledger.

   F4 BACKFILL -- cost fork
      E:obs 2,022 transcript files / 5,197 MB UNINDEXED, back to 2026-05-07.
      indexed window is only 2026-07-22+ -> 4,137 is a FLOOR, ~31% of files.
      cost : hours of indexing ; anamnesis.db 340 MB -> multi-GB ; C: ~30 GB free.
      a) backfill all      <- widest corpus, largest disk + time
      b) backfill 90 days  <- recommend : covers 2026-06-16+, bounded
      c) no backfill       <- ship on the 7-week window, revisit

%% I> what this is NOT  :: stated plainly, N! buried

   N! weight learning. Qwen3-Coder-Next is a Q2 GGUF on a 16 GB A770 under WDDM.
      there is no training path on this hardware and this blueprint does not
      pretend otherwise.
   I> "learning" here := a durable, provenance-tagged, retrievable representation
      of Apocky that the prompt assembler admits, refreshed without a human in
      the room. that IS autonomous, and it is the honest name for it.
   W! if weight-level adaptation is the requirement, that is a DIFFERENT build
      (LoRA on a smaller resident model) and needs its own blueprint + hardware
      decision. say so and it gets one.

